Native Transformers 5.23.0 NemotronHMamba2Mixer, NemotronHRMSNorm and weight
initialization are imported from the installed Apache-2.0 Transformers package.
They are not downloaded from, registered by or imported through the checkpoint.

This adaptation replaces temporary process-global block monkey-patching with
package-owned per-layer construction and Transformers 5 cache/mask APIs.
Original checkpoint Python is never executed.
